HST Office: the status bar of a document window in the HST look (tests first).

Tests with the declarations and stubs they need (<vcl/hst/statusbarcoat.hxx>,
vcl/source/hst/coat/coat-statusbar.cxx); they fail with assertions until the implementation follows.

--- /dev/null
+++ b/include/vcl/hst/statusbarcoat.hxx
@@ -0,0 +1,86 @@
+/* -*- Mode: C++; tab-width: 4; indent-tabs-mode: nil; c-basic-offset: 4 -*- */
+/*
+ * SPDX-License-Identifier: LicenseRef-HST-Proprietary
+ *
+ * This file is part of HST Office.
